  <!-- Onboarding -->
  <data name="Onboarding.WelcomeTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Welcome to Neyra Optimizer</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.WelcomeBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>Neyra Optimizer analyzes your Windows configuration and proposes safe, reversible optimizations for low-end and mid-range PCs. Nothing on your system is changed during first launch — we start with a read-only scan, then show you every proposed change before anything is applied.</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.SafetyTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Safety first</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.SafetyBullets" xml:space="preserve"><value>• A restore point / optimization snapshot is created before batches of changes
• Every change records its previous value and can be rolled back
• Windows Security, core services and system-critical components are always protected
• You approve each batch; nothing runs silently in the background</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.Consent" xml:space="preserve"><value>I understand that optimizing Windows modifies system configuration, and I allow Neyra Optimizer to make reviewed changes when I explicitly apply them.</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.ContinueReadOnly" xml:space="preserve"><value>Continue in read-only mode</value></data>
  <data name="Onboarding.StartScan" xml:space="preserve"><value>Agree &amp; run initial scan</value></data>

